      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "1.3",
      "title": "General requirements",
      "body": "All types of sabatons must respect the following requirements :\n● Be based on historical sources.\n● Have an anatomical shape of the foot.\n● Must reproduce the proportions based on historical sources.\n● Any metal part of the sabatons must conform to the Armors and weapons Aesthetics and decorations document.\n● Any textile or leather part of the sabatons must conform to the Textiles and Leather document.",
